  "interpretation_zh": "几何 Jacobi-PCGLS K16 在 546/546 单元和 13/13 完整几何上构成合格参考。low-64 K8 虽通过全部绝对门，却相对该参考为 0/546 matched；observation 与完整梯度在全部 546 单元都差逾 5%。因此当前固定 low-64 observation proxy warm-start 机制被独立确认关闭。",
  "interpretation_en": "Geometry-Jacobi PCGLS K16 is adequate in 546/546 cells and 13/13 complete geometries. Although low-64 K8 clears every absolute gate, it reaches 0/546 matched cells against that reference; observation and full-gradient errors are more than five percent worse in all 546 cells. The fixed low-64 observation-proxy warm-start mechanism is therefore independently closed.",
  "route_action_zh": "先结果前资格化最低仍充分的全局 PCGLS 深度，收紧 deterministic baseline；新 observation-only initializer 必须同时通过 matched accuracy、严格减少 A/A^T，并排除同价或更便宜控制。不得用大模型或 GPU 挽救当前代理。",
  "route_action_en": "Preregister the lowest globally adequate PCGLS depth to tighten the deterministic baseline. A new observation-only initializer must pass matched accuracy, strictly reduce A/A^T, and survive equal-or-cheaper control attribution. Do not rescue the current proxy with a larger model or GPU.",
